    participant CFG as ClientOnboardingConfig<br/>CLIENT-ALPHA [IMPLEMENTED]
    participant AUD as AuditLog<br/>in-memory [IMPLEMENTED]
    participant UC3 as UC-03<br/>Document Validation API<br/>[origin/Roshan only]

    rect rgb(219, 234, 254)
    note over EMP,UC1: Stage A + B - offer acceptance and case creation [PROPOSED]
    EMP->>SRC: Accept offer OFR-EMP-001
    SRC-->>UC1: offer_accepted=true<br/>accepted_at=2026-10-01T09:00:00Z
    UC1->>UC1: Check offer accepted
    UC1->>UC1: Check form submitted + approved
    UC1->>UC1: Check duplicate ACTIVE case
    UC1->>UC1: Check details consistent
    alt Any check fails
        UC1-->>SRC: PENDING or HR_REVIEW<br/>no case created
    else All checks pass
        UC1->>UC1: Create CASE-EMP-001
