    rect rgb(254, 243, 199)
    note over UC1,UC2: Trigger 1 [PROPOSED - NOT YET INTEGRATED]
    note right of UC1: No event bus, queue or webhook exists.<br/>Today the only entry point is an<br/>in-process Python call.
    UC1->>UC2: create_onboarding(actor, OnboardingTrigger)<br/>client_id, employee_id, joining_date,<br/>role_id, department, manager_id,<br/>location, project, offer, form
