    rect rgb(255, 237, 213)
    note over UC2: Stage G - UC-02 reaction
    note right of UC2: UC-02 has NO action_required status.<br/>Supported: blocked / ready / in_progress /<br/>complete / cancelled.
    UC2->>UC2: collect_documents NOT completed<br/>stays READY or IN_PROGRESS
    UC2->>UC2: visa_application stays BLOCKED<br/>(prerequisite enforced today)
    UC2->>UC2: build_reminder_drafts() - DRAFT ONLY,<br/>delivery_status = draft_not_sent
